Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你实战打得那么好  玩这个烂死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you be so good at combat? You stink at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  我记得我的军衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you need to relax. I believe I outrank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 比你高  - 别在我的地盘摆架子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- last time I checked. - Not in my house, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  敌军来袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Taking fire!
