Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公爵叔叔  你耳朵好大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Duke, you have big ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你头好大  过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a big head. Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回击敌人  现在怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Returning fire! What's up, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回击敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Returning fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尖叫也没用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't scream your way out of this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请求支援  虎爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, requesting assistance, brother Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法动弹  公爵  无法动弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pinned down, brother Duke. Pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我还有我的伙伴  地狱犬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all right. I got my boy here. Demon dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶奶  帮帮我们  我们需要后援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandma, help us! We need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是你第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the first time you sent a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让女孩子尖叫着逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}running out of the room screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是第一次让两个女孩子尖叫着逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the first time I sent two girls screaming from a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  这玩笑开得太不合适了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, completely inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说说而已  - 太不合适了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just saying. - Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统被暗杀之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violence continues across Pakistan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴基斯坦首都伊斯兰堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the capital of Islamabad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,持续发生暴力袭击事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}following the assassination of President...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为暗杀所造成的权力真空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future of the country and control of its nuclear arsenal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个国家的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appear to be up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及对其核武器的控制都成了未知数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the vacuum created by the killing remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(华盛顿哥伦比亚特区)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算巴基斯坦的总统死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pakistani President may in fact be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴基斯坦仍然是我们的盟国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Pakistan remains an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且是个主权国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a sovereign nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  那里不过是一个发生暴乱的地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, they're a riot with a zip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官  我们在这里争论的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, every minute we spend debating this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骚乱地区正潜伏着已激活的核弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are live nuclear warheads that sit amidst the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让敌人抢先拿到这些弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let our enemies get those warheads first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都有什么建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,潜入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻潜入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,静观其变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狭路相逢勇者胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}History rewards the bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会当那个坐视不理的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to be the man who waited and saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我把特种部队找来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星际一号指挥官准备行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star One Flight commander separating for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都给我听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,核弹头应该就在附近  一抢到手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That nuke cannot have gone far. Once we have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,返回着陆点的途中就立即解除激活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will disarm it en route to the L.Z.!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弹头的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have its location narrowed down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个导弹装配工厂内某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to somewhere in this missile assembly building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们从楼顶进入  之后分开行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go in on the roof, and fan out from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火石  杰伊  如果别人需要支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint, Jaye, if any support is needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们当援兵  拦路虎带领地面部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll reinforce as Roadblock leads the ground team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次跳伞的时候放了颗子弹在嘴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my first drop I popped a live round into my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样牙齿就不会打颤了  试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeps your teeth from chattering. Give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真好吃  - 好小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Delicious. - Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊  敌人装备如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye, what are we up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叛军用的都是卡拉什尼科夫冲锋枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insurgents are armed with Kalashnikovs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,SVD狙击步枪还有50式冲锋枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SVD Dragunovs and Type 50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是冷战时期的古董了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold War stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别掉以轻心  还是能把你们打个稀巴烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't relax, boys, still put holes in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What have you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P381黑风暴  全新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}P-dub 381 Black Tempest, just out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可绕行  0.25倍速  远程遥控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rounds. Quarter speed, remote controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候才能有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did we get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们没门  只有我们两个有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一流枪手专用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Distinguished Marksmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我看看  - 手别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me see. - Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩枪的女孩惹不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls with guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接近目标位置  注意  做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching target. Ten-hut! Make ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发  出发  出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁想蛇眼了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else missing Snake Eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟蛇眼在一起训练了六年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trained with Snake for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不在这儿一定有自己的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he ain't here, he's got good reason.
