Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  老规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother Block, as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们讲几句吧  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you mind leading us in a few words, please, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引用一下Jay-Z(美国HipHop歌手)的名言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the immortal words of Jay-Z,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论是何方神圣在指引我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Whatever deity may guide my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的主  别让我在今夜死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Lord, don't let me die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若只能止步于此  在我苏醒之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But if I shall, before I wake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿接受我的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I accept my fate."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大胆上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大胆上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大胆上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah.
