Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说说而已  - 给我  闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just saying. - Just shut up.
