Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经扣了一次扳机  现在轮到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pulled a trigger. Now I pull a trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  不带这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样做不算数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not gonna count.
