Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给我女儿买了一台卡拉OK机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought my little girls a karaoke machine
