Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  李·哈维(刺杀肯尼迪的凶手)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough out of you, Lee Harvey.
