Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐意至极  总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be my pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队马上就要消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The G.I. Joes are about to be out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"马上要消失"的意思是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And by "Out of the picture," I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们打回原形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alive on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们太具威胁性了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a little too close to Mount Olympus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须把他们赶尽杀绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to strike them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会找到你的  扎坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll find you out, Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他们找不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是纳米虫的厉害之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the beauty of Nanomites.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  让你见识一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完美无瑕的微技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flawless microtechnology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闲话少说  让他坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recess over. Sit him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都说当总统是吃力不讨好的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they say this is a thankless job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是昨天我居然和博诺(爱尔兰摇滚乐队U2的主唱)出去玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But yesterday I hung out with Bono.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的新特勤处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My new Secret Service,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想把美国宪法给烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they want to burn the Constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真心想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我那些实习生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my interns...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我把实习生都带回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I brought back the interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我最喜欢什么吗  可以随便炸东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know my favourite bit? I get to blow stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个讨人喜欢的做法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet that endears you to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.30,0:23:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的支持率上升了9个百分点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your approval ratings climbed nine points.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  美国民众想要一个面容如你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, America wants someone who looks like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但行动如我的总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but acts like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这张嘴很能说哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the quicker blower-upper, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个弊端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one drawback.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.23,0:23:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想你的小娇妻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little wifey-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你若敢动我家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you touch my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm yanking your chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当了两届总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two long terms of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只当了几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just a few short months of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就别浪费我剩下的这点时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's not waste the time I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关押眼镜蛇指挥官和迪斯特罗的监狱在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the prison that holds Cobra Commander, and Destro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该问你  你葫芦里卖的是什么药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this where I ask you, what do you have planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么大家都想做总统吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does anyone want to be President?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为人人都想统治世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody wants to rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各小队  带好行装  离开着陆点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All squads, gear up and clear the L.Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫拔出  我们是牙齿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extraction? What are we, teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 联系上总部了吗  - 还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Reach H.Q.? - No, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.23,0:24:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 到高处试试  - 明白  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go up high. - Roger, Sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.66,0:24:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都归队了  一滴血都没流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our men accounted for. Not a single drop of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 完胜  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boots to asses. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.41,0:24:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了  你擦伤了手肘吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for that... Did you scrape your elbow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没  红汗症而已  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's red sweat. - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好是你打人后留下的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That better have been on somebody's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.51,0:24:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保安部队来早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 趴下  - 找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get down! - Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.19,0:24:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.90,0:24:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起武器  走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To your weapons! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卧倒  卧倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the ground! On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们赶出着陆点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get 'em out of the L.Z.!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要医护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火石被击中了  火石被击中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint's down! Flint's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去救他  - 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going for him! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意10点钟方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,部队遇袭  请求紧急空中支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Troops in contact! Request immediate air support!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍  请求紧急空中支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, immediate air support!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.08,0:25:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧  快  我们得离开这里  走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right? Come on, we got to move! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You good? You hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  火石安全了  我们需要掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block, I got Flint. We got to get to cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敌机来袭  快跑  快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming! Incoming! Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公爵  回话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duke, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.45,0:26:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to cover, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 撤退  回集结点  - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! Pull back! Rally point! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳进井里去  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the well! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear 'em out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检查完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.13,0:27:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道了敌人的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have met the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.81,0:28:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(美国总统发表全国讲话)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敌人就是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天  世界精英战斗队伍  特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, the world's elite fighting force, the G.I. Joes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.81,0:28:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.57,0:28:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摈弃了他们的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}abandoned their duty
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打破了他们与美国人民以及把人身安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and broke the sacred bond that exists between the American people
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托付给他们的人之间神圣的约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those entrusted with their security.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,预备  走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready and step.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.26,0:28:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready and
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}step!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.09,0:28:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴基斯塔总统率先遇刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first domino fell with the murder of the Pakistani president.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.01,0:28:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刺客是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名特种兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.01,0:29:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,代号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}call sign
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:28:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛇眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他并非单独作案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he didn't act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.91,0:29:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队企图利用当前局势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Joes intended to use this situation
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夺取巴基斯坦的核武库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to seize Pakistan's nuclear arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.81,0:29:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.29,0:29:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this incident
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们清醒地认识到核武器带来的灾祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}serves as a sobering reminder of the scourge of nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.21,0:29:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to that end,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我号召世界领袖们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call upon my fellow world leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上聚集起来讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to convene immediately to discuss
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,核裁军的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nuclear disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我数三下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.23,0:29:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队的行为已明显越线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The G.I. Joes clearly went beyond the boundaries of their mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.53,0:29:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的指挥下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my orders
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.81,0:29:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.90,0:29:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个代号为眼镜蛇的秘密特种部队  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a covert Special Forces unit code named Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消灭了特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}terminated with extreme prejudice Joe Command,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.45,0:29:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破坏其设备并歼灭全员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}facilities, personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:30:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队已不复存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The G.I. Joes are no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里什么都没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.89,0:30:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing left here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.22,0:30:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他不是那个意思  - 这里有我们兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not what he meant! - These are our brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what he meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.77,0:31:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,袭击我们的人还会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever did this is going to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.74,0:31:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得转移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是我们的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are our leader now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.75,0:31:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们向正东前进直到摆脱危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We head due east until we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会找出是谁杀害了公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna find the man who did this to Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.31,0:32:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾恩萨根地下监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛇眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然能在这里见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last place I thought I'd see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.19,0:32:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是监狱长詹姆斯  很荣幸见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warden James. It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.07,0:32:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是你的大粉丝  我喜欢这身黑衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a very big fan. I love the black.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.87,0:32:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.87,0:32:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有约翰尼·卡什(美国乡村音乐歌手)的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very Johnny Cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  欢迎你来到艾恩萨根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Welcome to Einsargen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.37,0:32:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你介绍一下这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you a little bit about the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.04,0:32:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我  像个房地产经纪人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. I sound like a real-estate agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.96,0:32:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是来卖东西给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here to sell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许只剩绝望可以给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except maybe hopelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:32:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旅途愉快吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始觉得头晕目眩了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sensation that you're feeling, your upside-down tummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.95,0:33:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们正在下降到前东德的一个矿井里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's due to our descent into a former East German mine shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们最深的一个矿井\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the deepest they ever dug.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.12,0:33:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  你刚刚已经离开德国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So deep in fact that you just crossed out of Germany
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入了国际领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into international territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.54,0:33:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which allows me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定的权限自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}certain jurisdictional freedoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.31,0:33:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One word,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了  这个房间简直棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}awesome. This room is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.73,0:33:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的温度原本超过摄氏100度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temperatures here exceed 210 degrees
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但人工降到了摄氏20度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when not artificially cooled to a crisp 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.40,0:33:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都差点要盖毛毯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost calls for a Snuggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.49,0:34:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看完下一个再惊叹吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till you see this next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.42,0:34:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吧  这里简直秒杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what I mean? This just slays me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太有趣了  这里就要用到科学了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so interesting. This is where science has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知不知道  在快速眼动睡眠阶段时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that during REM sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the human body
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会制造出一种神经化学物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}produces a neural chemical
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它能够麻痹除了心脏和眼睛以外的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which paralyses every muscle in the body
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.77,0:34:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全身肌肉  从而阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the heart and the eyes? This prevents us
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们梦游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from acting out our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两人已被注入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have injected both of these men
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种类似的合成物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a synthetic version.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.36,0:34:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们完全醒着  有意识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're perfectly awake. They're conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能察觉到周围的一切事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're aware of everything that's going on around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是被困在自己的身体里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that they're trapped inside themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.87,0:34:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该认识你的新邻居吧  这是迪斯特罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I believe you know your new neighbours, Destro,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.59,0:34:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是眼镜蛇指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们三个就像是我的橄榄球梦之队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the three of you are like my fantasy football team.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.93,0:35:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.40,0:35:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你东张西望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now as your eyes and mind
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心不在焉  那我就让你痛苦一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}travel to where you cannot, I want you to agonise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你吃点苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to pine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.24,0:35:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你为即将逝去的自由而痛心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to ache for what once was and will never be again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.91,0:35:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你觉得"逃走"这个词根本不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to doubt that there was ever a word for escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛇眼说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake Eyes speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然从没想过你的声音会是怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never occurred to me what you might sound like, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我却构想过你的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always thought about what you might look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱下他的面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.95,0:36:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.79,0:36:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你把巴基斯坦总统干掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you killed the Pakistani president.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你并不是我的首选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're not exactly my first-round draft pick,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我一直都很欣赏你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've always been a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按规矩我们该发出求救呼叫  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protocol says we make a distress call, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  部队都没了  规矩也就没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Protocol died with the unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.85,0:36:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别人怎么知道我们没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's anybody gonna know we're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不用知道  因为我们已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not, 'cause we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.18,0:36:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对于我们的政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To our government,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家人  特别是敌人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to our families, but especially to our enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.11,0:36:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们凌晨六点在印度河谷荒漠被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were KIA at 0600 hours in the Indus Valley Desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们至少得试试  也许有人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have to at least try. I mean, there might be someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.44,0:36:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们现在做什么都要绝对保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Anything we do now is a rumour of a rumour.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.28,0:36:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有能证明我们活着的证据都没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any and all traces of our existence is terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.74,0:36:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我所信任的也只有蛇眼一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only one I trust out there is Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候袭击我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we got hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.67,0:36:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样袭击我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how we got hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始这局就已设好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were set up right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能下令发动这种袭击的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many stars would someone need on their shoulder
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.22,0:37:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肩章上得有几颗星  四颗还是五颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to call an attack like that? Four? Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是肩章上有星的  是衣服上有扣子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not stars. Buttons on his suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是国家安全顾问  或者国防部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}National Security Advisor. Secretary of Defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.60,0:37:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  能发动这种袭击的只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. There's only one man who could authorise a strike like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.73,0:37:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还给他投过票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I voted for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜蛇指挥官生命体征稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All vitals on Cobra Commander are steady.
