Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心脏停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.38,0:39:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快  这不是演习  把手铐拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly! No drill! Bring the restraints!
