Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.93,0:39:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血清在哪里  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the serum? Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.31,0:39:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肾上腺素  快点  肾上腺素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrenaline now. Now! Adrenaline!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.85,0:39:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Quickly, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.23,0:40:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要磨叽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血清在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the serum?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.37,0:40:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到后面去  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peel back! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.53,0:40:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫他没有心跳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, his heart stopped beating?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.45,0:40:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我下令  这里不准有人死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one here dies unless I say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.87,0:40:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快开枪  开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他拿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他拿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,北边没有异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear on the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.10,0:41:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.30,0:43:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.05,0:43:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许让人活着走出那扇门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shoot anything that walks through that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.97,0:43:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都给我毙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.97,0:43:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.98,0:43:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真靠得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.94,0:43:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜蛇指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪斯特罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of the band.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.07,0:43:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.58,0:43:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.01,0:44:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你找了人来接应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've arranged transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.57,0:44:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在早上9点前炸掉的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making more things go boom by 9:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.69,0:44:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比其他人一天能炸掉的还多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than most people do all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.86,0:44:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萤火虫  很高兴见到你  老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firefly. Good to see you, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.62,0:44:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.74,0:44:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可就是有人不让我进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people just didn't want to let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我逃出过八座监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I busted out of eight prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.79,0:44:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闯监狱还是第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I only broke into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.38,0:44:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有通信已被切断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All communications have been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人会知道你不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will know you're even missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.19,0:45:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带去山里治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him to the mountains to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在接下来要发动的战争里  还用得着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need him for the war I'm about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.23,0:45:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想帮你的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.12,0:45:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵受伤了  我们清楚他要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've seen Storm's injuries. We know where he's headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.17,0:46:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.55,0:46:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(宙斯工业综合体)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官  发射操控中心就快建好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, launch controls are nearly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直是主管在主持大局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The director was running behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里再也不归他管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he ain't running behind no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.90,0:46:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其它地方也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or anywhere else, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.54,0:46:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盔甲已按您的要求制作完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armour prototype is complete to your specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.70,0:46:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天把马力加到了60\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it up to 60 on the dyno today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.83,0:46:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的名字您一定喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll like this. Working title,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.83,0:46:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高速哨兵  HISS\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High Speed Sentry. HISS.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.75,0:46:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎您回来  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to have you back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.97,0:46:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很美吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't she a beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.97,0:46:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界很快就会臣服于宙斯的脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon the world will cower in the face of Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.77,0:47:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在只差我们的指挥官了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we've been missing is our Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.41,0:47:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面具不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.12,0:47:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone took his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.46,0:47:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要从那个又大又白  有11间卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not easy to sneak out of that big, white,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.63,0:47:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,35个半浴室的房子里溜出来很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11-bedroom, 35-and-a-half bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.42,0:47:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了是谁帮你坐到现在的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't forget who put you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.80,0:47:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也别忘了你的卑贱出身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the rock you crawled out from.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.93,0:47:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萤火虫  还好我们的疯狂不减当年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firefly. It's good to know we're not running low on crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.14,0:47:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十只手指还健全吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still all 10 fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.10,0:47:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前任总统怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is our former President?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.94,0:47:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他价值连城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is worth his weight in platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.52,0:47:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说当总统很无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they call it a waterboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我一点都不觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I never get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.45,0:47:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,48小时后  宙斯就能发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 48 hours, Zeus will launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.12,0:47:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one wrinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:48:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有三个特种兵在这次围剿中逃生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three Joes somehow survived our little house cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.37,0:48:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无人机在印度河谷捕捉到了他们的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A drone picked up voiceprints in the Indus Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还能指望你办成什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I trust you with nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.46,0:48:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会露出马脚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll slip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.97,0:48:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦露出马脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就去解决他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hunt them to ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.64,0:48:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  你们看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.80,0:48:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.36,0:48:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迷路了吗  小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.60,0:48:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没迷路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I ain't lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.48,0:48:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走错路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you got the wrong street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是带着麦莉·赛勒斯(美国女演员)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you take Miley Cyrus
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.52,0:48:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.52,0:48:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和瑞安·西克雷斯特(美国电视节目主持)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Ryan Seacrest
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.08,0:48:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往回走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and head back that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.48,0:48:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.84,0:48:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.04,0:49:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧  马文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.68,0:49:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别这样叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, don't call me that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.08,0:49:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  小马文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up? Little Marvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.68,0:49:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马文?  - 现在是大马文了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marvin? - Big Marvin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.12,0:49:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓到了嘛  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you worried for a minute, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.94,0:49:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心你的包  被抢走就不好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your handbag there, boy. You don't want them to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.82,0:49:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看你  块头这么大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you. You got grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.28,0:49:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸妈怎么让你长那么壮的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How your parents make a kid this big, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他父母都只有1米57  - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His parents are like 5'2" apiece. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.58,0:49:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.58,0:49:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你按《90天魔鬼训练法》训练了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're taking that P90X serious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.41,0:49:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一周练两次呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twice a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.66,0:49:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧你脖子那么粗就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. Look at the size of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.58,0:49:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来介绍一下  这是火石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me introduce you. This is Flint.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.38,0:49:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊女郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.13,0:49:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊女郎  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Jaye. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 欢迎回来  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome back. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.51,0:49:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遇到困难时就会回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what happens when you're in trouble, you come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.59,0:49:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家就是避风港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home is where the help is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.26,0:49:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会帮你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.93,0:49:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们去娱乐中心住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set up at the rec centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.56,0:49:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,避避风头  没人会来打扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lay low over there. Nobody gonna bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.31,0:49:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要用车的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as wheels go,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.48,0:49:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就用我的卡车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna let you roll my truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.48,0:49:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.32,0:49:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前我就是开这车去收保护费的  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got payments on that truck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.82,0:49:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱不像以前那样好赚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it like I used to. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.86,0:49:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了  斯多普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Stoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.65,0:49:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你一个人情  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you one, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.66,0:49:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  你欠了两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, you owe me two.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那次不算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That other one don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.75,0:50:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回家  马文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.67,0:50:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里很多年没人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's been here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.99,0:50:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这暂时就是我们的窝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna have to be our pit for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还真乱得跟狗窝一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. It's an actual pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.19,0:50:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前经常来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my old stomping ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.94,0:50:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的可以信任这个斯多普吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure we can trust this Stoop guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.94,0:50:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯多普不是天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stoop's no angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.94,0:50:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他是家人  可以信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he is family and we can trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会不会被追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we be traced?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.37,0:50:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以将IP地址隐藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can mask our IP addresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会每六小时发送一次加密信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll cyber-blast an encoded beacon every six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.96,0:50:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有特种兵幸存下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any Joes did survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.46,0:50:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得让他知道我们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need to let them know where we're at.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.79,0:50:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Well, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.25,0:50:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火石  列出我们所剩的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint, inventory every piece of equipment we got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.55,0:50:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊  开始调查总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye, start that database on our President.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.76,0:51:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得知道总司令到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find out what's going on with our Commander-in-Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.55,0:51:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的所作所为不像我们所认识的总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not acting like the man we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.65,0:51:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找出这个原因  我们就能恢复身份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find out why, we can start being soldiers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊女郎中尉  请求紧急救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Lady Jaye, requesting immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有任何幸存下来的特种兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any Joes have survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.54,0:52:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个频道只有特种兵能收到对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This channel's restricted to Joes, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.37,0:52:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,波多马克河的西面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnetic west of the Potomac.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.54,0:52:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.88,0:52:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰伊女郎中尉  请求紧急救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lieutenant Lady Jaye requesting immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊女郎中尉  我们是金克斯和蛇眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Lady Jaye, this is Jinx and Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.26,0:52:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在追捕白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are in pursuit of Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便蛇眼和金克斯抓到了白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if Snake Eyes and Jinx grab Storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.77,0:52:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也还在地球的另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're still halfway around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.23,0:52:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能靠自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.73,0:52:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够打一场战役了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough for a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.07,0:52:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不够打一场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.24,0:52:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要打的是场硬仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fighting uphill here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.83,0:52:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我14岁来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here when I was 14
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.28,0:52:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前以为只能活到13岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a life expectancy of 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.83,0:52:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从一个家迁到另一个家  直到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was bounced around from home to home, until this
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为了我的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}became my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.46,0:52:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人在门口排着队找我打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys were lined up outside that door to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.51,0:53:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮包骨的我被揍得多了  就乐在其中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They whooped my skinny ass so much I started to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到有一年冬天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till one winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我长高了20公分  重了27公斤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grew 8 inches and gained 60 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.68,0:53:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把一个人打得连胳膊都抬不起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I punched a guy so hard he couldn't move his arm to tap out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.35,0:53:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来特种部队来这一带招人的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then when the Joes came recruiting to the hood,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.81,0:53:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经将他们中的一半人都打倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd already beaten down half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.69,0:53:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我成为了一名实地作战的特种兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became a Joe to serve. In the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.24,0:53:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果我们打的是硬仗  那就硬打吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if we're fighting uphill, we take the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.37,0:53:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我查到一些你们感兴趣的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I got something you'll want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.12,0:53:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我调查总统的时候发现了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}During my check of the President, look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.38,0:53:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是8月9日的总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the President on August 9th.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.05,0:53:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对海外能源的依赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an addiction to offshore energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.13,0:53:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令我们某种程度上被迫卷入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we're forced to be kind of embroiled
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.09,0:53:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外国的内政之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the affairs of foreign nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.14,0:53:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是10天后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is 10 days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.35,0:53:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  不然我们就有点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, otherwise, we're sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.52,0:53:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是讲话中的补白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are conversational fillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.44,0:53:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会蹦出一些无实意的词以使大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little phrases we spit out to give our brain a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:53:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能赶上嘴巴  比如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to catch up with our mouth. Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.94,0:54:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- "比如"这个词  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.53,0:54:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那总统怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our President?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.11,0:54:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8月9日到19日之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between August 9th and August 19th,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不再使用"你知道""某种程度"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he stopped using "you know" and "kind of"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.03,0:54:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转而使用"我是说""有点"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and started using "I mean" and "sort of."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.53,0:54:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止这些  "晚饭"变成了"晚餐"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not all. "Supper" became "dinner."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"苏打水"换成了"汽水"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Soda" became "pop."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.83,0:54:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个总统  行为却不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One President, two fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.67,0:54:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过这也就几句话而已吧  这能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's a few words, right? I mean, how much can...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.63,0:54:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.67,0:54:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两次新闻发布会  7月31日  9月1日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two press conferences, July 31st, September 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.51,0:54:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他手指交叉的方式了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See his fingers clasped?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.01,0:54:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一张左手拇指在上  一张右手拇指在上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left thumb on top versus right thumb on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.39,0:54:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同一个人绝不会有两种交叉方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same person never does this differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.26,0:54:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉会不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it feels wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.52,0:54:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有可能现在的总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the President
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.52,0:54:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是总统本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't the President?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们的总司令是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if the Commander-in-Chief is an imposter
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.19,0:54:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下令袭击的人又是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's the one that ordered the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就必须假定任何人都不可信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to assume that there's no one we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.03,0:54:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个人可信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队的名称就是由他而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the reason we call ourselves Joes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.90,0:55:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要两盒薄荷巧克力  一盒查克拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take two cases of Thin Mints and a box of Chuckle Lucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.92,0:55:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔顿将军  请允许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Colton, if I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.22,0:55:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  布伦达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut your mouth, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不叫布伦达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's not Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:55:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.94,0:56:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长官  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.94,0:56:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是马文中士  - 我知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant Marvin... - I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.44,0:56:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那您也一定知道我为什么会来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.12,0:56:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是没听见你们说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like I don't hear what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.29,0:56:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你说总统是假的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But an imposter President?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.71,0:56:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么将军说出来就听起来像疯话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come when the General says it, it sounds crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.88,0:56:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把真正的总统怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they do with the real President?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.17,0:56:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们担心他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fear he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.55,0:56:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不这么认为  没人会杀最有利的棋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so. You're not going to kill your best asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,康拉德·豪泽尔 公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Conrad Hauser. Duke."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.64,0:56:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.15,0:56:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我他是怎样一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me one thing you know about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.65,0:56:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.40,0:56:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挚友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.99,0:56:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他救了我的命  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he saved my life, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.04,0:57:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.58,0:57:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说的是叛国之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're proposing is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.92,0:57:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要更多的证据才能开展行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need something a little more to go on
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.26,0:57:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光拇指交叉这点是不够的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than overlapping thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.26,0:57:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在退休之前  曾经在一个安全委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you retired, you served on a security commission
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.55,0:57:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与总统的参谋长共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the President's Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.72,0:57:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔顿将军  你能让我们接近他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Colton, can you get us close?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.93,0:57:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.44,0:57:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个城市里我不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't scratch my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.50,0:57:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有所行动还不被监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this town without getting on the watch list.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.61,0:57:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布伦达  把那支钢笔递给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brenda, hand me that pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是女童子军  现在是秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girl Scout to secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒  我不叫布伦达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing. Name's not Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.78,0:57:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,递支笔而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.24,0:57:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔治敦  K大街  晚上9点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avenue K, Georgetown. 9:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.79,0:57:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,参谋长会去那里打牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a poker game with the Chief of Staff there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.63,0:57:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他牌打得很烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a good poker player.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.29,0:57:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破绽百出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got 1,000 tells.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要一个破绽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.89,0:58:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚打完牌  算是花钱买教训了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just got out of poker. Poorer but wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.77,0:58:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上今天还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a good day, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.94,0:58:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统又开始吃他那些奇怪的药片了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prez was taking his crazy pills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  我回头打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, I'm gonna have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.82,0:58:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.83,0:58:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.83,0:58:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要帮你提袋子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a hand with your bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.46,0:58:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.55,0:58:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.01,0:58:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说好男人都死光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said chivalry is dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.51,0:58:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是那么说  我就有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk like that, I'm gonna get myself in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.85,0:58:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.06,0:58:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就到那边的街角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.69,0:58:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那阵刺痛感是异戊巴比妥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That tingly feeling is amobarbital.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.74,0:58:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是能造成顺行性遗忘的镇静剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a sedative that causes anterograde amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:58:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后你就会睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In five minutes, you're gonna be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.95,0:59:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再过五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In another five,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.57,0:59:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就会醒过来  根本不记得我这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna wake up with no idea I ever existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.17,0:59:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有发现你老大不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice anything strange about your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧  怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.63,0:59:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你得帮我们打个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're gonna make a phone call for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.96,0:59:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好让我们能接近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.01,0:59:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过别担心  你会忘了发生的这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry. You're gonna forget everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.68,0:59:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你的良心不会受谴责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so your conscience will be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.68,0:59:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.85,0:59:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你你也不会相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.06,0:59:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the call.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.24,1:08:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.34,1:08:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生最近春风得意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}El Presidente is on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.18,1:08:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的数字上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His numbers are up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.68,1:08:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的可不只是他的年龄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not just talking about his age.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.02,1:08:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不会说我们的总司令已经老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm not gonna call our Commander-in-Chief old.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.98,1:08:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  他有一天打电话来问我的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, he called me the other day for some advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.98,1:08:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚上好  - 晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.98,1:08:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想把国家的核武库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to hook up the nation's nuclear arsenal
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.82,1:08:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装上声控开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Clapper.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.87,1:08:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  女士  您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, ma'am, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.16,1:08:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迟到了  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.87,1:08:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我耗费了一个军队的兵力才打扮好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine the army it takes to make me look like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.50,1:08:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我无礼  我真想在那支军队的名单上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me. That's an army I'd like to enlist in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.04,1:08:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说到名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of lists,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.05,1:08:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您能否解释下为什么您不在我们的名单上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you like to explain why you're not on ours?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿呢  参谋长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here she is. Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩得开心点  范德沃特小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your evening, Miss Vandervoort.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.19,1:09:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.40,1:09:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到  待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that. Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.27,1:09:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.07,1:09:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心点  注意安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your head down. Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.70,1:09:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡维尔先生友好地提到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Carville was nice enough to mention
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.24,1:09:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我热衷的事项之一  核裁军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of my passions. Nuclear disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.53,1:09:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几天之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In just days,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.99,1:09:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界八大核国家的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the leaders of the world's eight nuclear nations
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将齐聚历史悠久的萨姆特堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will gather at historic Fort Sumter
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,召开核峰会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.17,1:09:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在原子八国共商大事前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But before the Atomic Eight break bread,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.05,1:09:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  詹姆斯  非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, James. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.18,1:09:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统先生  我是福克斯新闻的艾米·范德沃特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr President. Amy Vandervoort, Fox News.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.73,1:09:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福克斯  当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fox, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你看起来才那么"公平公正"(福克斯新闻的口号)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you look so "Fair and balanced."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.57,1:10:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣  不过我希望能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very cute. But I was actually hoping to have a...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.32,1:10:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳支舞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想说  引用您的一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to say, quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.36,1:10:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here's a quote.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的核峰会之后世界就会改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world will change after my nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跳支舞怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about we dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.58,1:10:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我不会跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really, I don't dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.75,1:10:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.46,1:10:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  总统先生  您给了我所需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr President. You gave me what I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.79,1:10:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我得回去赶稿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I really have to make my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.55,1:10:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很高兴见到您  - 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-It's been a pleasure. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.26,1:10:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.85,1:10:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.52,1:10:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从他的上衣取到一根头发  希望够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a strand of hair from his jacket. I hope it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.53,1:10:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.11,1:10:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等待身份验证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standing by for I.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.83,1:10:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有部门  进入橙色预警  待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units, setting condition orange. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.88,1:11:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不接受拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.89,1:11:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.97,1:11:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油  快点  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.85,1:11:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zartan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.56,1:11:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊  赶快离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye, get out of there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.86,1:11:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.69,1:11:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有不明身份者  她是特种兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an unauthorised I.D. She's a Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有特种兵出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a Joe on the premises.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.83,1:11:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.87,1:11:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊  快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.01,1:11:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.26,1:11:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,执行B计划  去B地点会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B, rendezvous Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.84,1:11:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  去C地点会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative. Proceed to rendezvous Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.80,1:11:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.39,1:11:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.22,1:11:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉  杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.43,1:11:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来我全盘接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.06,1:12:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有证据了  可以拿去给乔·科尔顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have proof. We're taking it to Joe Colton.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.07,1:12:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事你自己早已计划好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You planned this all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.73,1:12:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.40,1:12:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是律师  我们是战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't lawyers. We're soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.24,1:12:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过要找出幕后主使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I was gonna find the man who did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.03,1:12:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.16,1:12:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! That's... No. Negative!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.62,1:12:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  虎爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block. Block.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他奶奶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.67,1:12:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一枪毙命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One in the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.93,1:12:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  虎爷  你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block? Block, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.45,1:13:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看的就是那表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see that face.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道自己死期将至的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one where you realise today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.83,1:13:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的小兵们在沙漠里被我点烟花一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the face all those pretty little Joes had in the desert
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.46,1:13:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点着时  脸上都有这个表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I lit them all up like fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.99,1:14:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想看到那表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really want to see that face.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.29,1:14:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.49,1:14:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.70,1:14:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果眼镜蛇和扎坦都在白宫里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Cobra and Zartan are in the White House,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.20,1:14:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那世界就危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then the world is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.50,1:14:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm Shadow
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说出眼镜蛇的最终计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will tell us Cobra's endgame,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.04,1:14:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然就用你杀害师傅的刀将你斩杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or die by the same sword you once used to kill our master.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.74,1:14:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.87,1:15:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们敬爱的哈德大师赐予你的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given to you by our beloved Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.25,1:15:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否承认  是嫉妒与憎恨让你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you deny that your envy and hatred drove you to shed
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.87,1:15:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀害了哈德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Hard Master's blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.13,1:15:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当憎恨多到无以复加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's possible to feel so much hate
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.26,1:15:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,便会对之麻木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you stop feeling it at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.43,1:15:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像鱼在水中而不自知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a fish not knowing it's in water.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.56,1:15:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我的宿命早已被他人注定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my path was chosen for me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.44,1:15:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括我的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by my enemy
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.77,1:15:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀害哈德大师后嫁祸于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who framed me for killing the Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.24,1:15:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my friends
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.16,1:15:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信这骗局的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who believed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.70,1:15:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对双眼被蒙蔽之人  为何徒劳去辩解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why defend yourself to men too blind to see?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.29,1:15:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血是哈德大师的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the Hard Master's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that is not...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.85,1:16:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.39,1:16:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.40,1:16:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岚影一族之刃是不会断的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arashikage steel does not break.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.41,1:16:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一遍又一遍地自问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have asked myself over and over
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.58,1:16:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁如此蔑视我  甚至要毁我一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who despised me enough to destroy my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry, Storm Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.96,1:16:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但陷害你之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who would stand to gain the most
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.52,1:16:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是最大的得利者呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by framing you for this crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.80,1:16:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,令你亡命天涯的年轻对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your young adversary who chased you away?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.15,1:16:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是将落魄的你收留的那人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the man into whose arms you were chased.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.36,1:17:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人接纳了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who welcomed you,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.15,1:17:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好心对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}showed you kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.78,1:17:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.28,1:17:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我将成为那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For who I would become.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.54,1:17:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为身怀绝技的愤怒勇士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A warrior of great skill and anger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.88,1:17:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陷害我的人诡计多端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who betrayed me was capable of great ingenuity,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.17,1:17:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,崇尚暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}violence,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.60,1:17:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but most of all,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.68,1:17:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,善于伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disguise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.85,1:17:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.02,1:17:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.61,1:17:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们他和眼镜蛇的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what he and Cobra have planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.15,1:17:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好让我们齐心协力歼灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can destroy our common enemy
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.66,1:17:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.54,1:17:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.58,1:17:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要再说一遍指关节该怎么攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to remind me how knuckles are supposed to strike again?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.17,1:18:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要团结一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.46,1:18:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were your words.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.72,1:18:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只是见机行事  - 别掩饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I had a shot and I took it. - Now, don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.30,1:18:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经胡来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.39,1:18:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还会这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.43,1:18:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  接下来你还有什么大计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? And what was your big plan, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.85,1:18:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去自杀吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.68,1:18:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.54,1:18:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你唯命是从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I listened to everything you said over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.02,1:18:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来不过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never questioned...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.23,1:18:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再牺牲战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't going to bury any more Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.87,1:18:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要大开杀戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got guns to clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.68,1:18:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我拉下拉链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.98,1:19:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.17,1:19:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我爸能看到我现在的样子就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my dad could see me now...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.42,1:19:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.59,1:19:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.43,1:19:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我家三代从军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third generation military.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他做梦都想第四代也从军  然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperately wanted a fourth, and
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.73,1:19:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈就生了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my mom had me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.36,1:19:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他一定很为你感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he must be real proud of you, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.19,1:19:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不信任女军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't believe in female soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.11,1:19:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于鼓起勇气问他原因时  他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally asked him why. He said
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.20,1:19:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不想将自己的性命交到一个女人手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he didn't want to put his life in the hands of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.62,1:20:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二天我就入伍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I enlisted the next day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,努力了七年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spent the next seven years
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.55,1:20:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只为了军衔超过他  好让他向我敬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to outrank him so he'd have to salute me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.76,1:20:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.98,1:20:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前他就去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died before I got the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.90,1:20:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.25,1:20:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会怀念刚才穿红衣的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm actually gonna miss the red.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.05,1:20:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你美极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look real nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  要大开杀戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I said we got guns to clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这世界自己救不了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world ain't saving itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.69,1:21:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一下是因为你的加税法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was for the tax hike.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.65,1:21:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得好像你缴过税似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you pay taxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.98,1:21:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是替众人不平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't always about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.98,1:21:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留着他还有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still need the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.37,1:21:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,况且  打在他身  痛在我心啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, we've grown close.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.66,1:21:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵能来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Storm Shadow in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心他  他一定能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you worry about him. He'll be more than ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.00,1:21:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的内阁班子看来不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not too impressed with your Cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.51,1:21:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又没通过听证会  凑合着用吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No confirmation hearings, that's what you get.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.55,1:21:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.34,1:21:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由我来接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.26,1:21:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制这个手提箱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who controls this briefcase,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.56,1:21:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能控制美国核武库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}controls the U.S. nuclear arsenal
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.35,1:21:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及全人类的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the fate of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.19,1:21:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,张开眼睛  前总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes, Mr Ex-President.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.78,1:21:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛是心灵的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyes are the windows to the soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.28,1:21:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,张大点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.70,1:21:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宙斯已经造好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zeus is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.66,1:22:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万事俱备  只欠东风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need one final piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.42,1:22:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.88,1:22:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,历史自有公断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}History will stand in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.72,1:22:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜断的不是我  是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not of me. Of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.18,1:22:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何  杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we got, Jaye?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.73,1:22:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎坦全神贯注于这个核峰会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zartan's entire focus has been this nuclear summit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.40,1:22:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是他计划的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to be the key to whatever he's planning.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.19,1:22:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那就是我们的目标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Well, then that's our target.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.03,1:22:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.70,1:22:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.05,1:23:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次我比你快了  蛇眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm faster than you, Snake Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的忍者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn Ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.31,1:23:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你太好了  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.27,1:23:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.07,1:23:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是金克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.40,1:23:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我们这边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.83,1:23:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是你们这边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.66,1:23:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是这一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for this once,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.83,1:23:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是敌人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.46,1:23:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我们多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of our men has he killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.50,1:23:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们难道要和他并肩作战吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to fight with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.51,1:23:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界各国的首脑明天将召集  那是陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The leaders of the world will gather tomorrow. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.64,1:23:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有白幽灵知道眼镜蛇的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm is the only one who knows Cobra's plan
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.81,1:23:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他了如指掌  能帮我们设法阻止那计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside and out. He can help us find a way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.73,1:23:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们必须合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have to work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.82,1:23:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.65,1:23:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.58,1:24:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.59,1:24:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好你的邻居也藏了不少货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes you wonder about your neighbours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.27,1:24:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帅气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.41,1:24:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻开那个沙发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up that couch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.29,1:24:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有需要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.54,1:24:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自有准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.96,1:24:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.24,1:25:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那支是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.58,1:25:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.58,1:25:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是巴顿将军的枪  没错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This really is Patton's gun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.24,1:25:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他家人送我的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gift from his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.75,1:25:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无上的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.67,1:25:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.75,1:25:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在考虑给你弄个配得上你的大家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was actually thinking about something a little more your size.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.26,1:25:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可别给我刮花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to scratch her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.93,1:25:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挂空档时候会有点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idles a little rough in neutral.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.06,1:25:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不挂空档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't gonna be in neutral.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.82,1:25:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.57,1:26:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国防部说我不可以复出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DOD says I can't come out of retirement.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.41,1:26:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可没说我不能重新入伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't say anything about reenlisting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.29,1:26:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向你报到  军士长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reporting for duty, Sergeant Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想带上一群老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to bring a couple friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.38,1:26:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔顿的队伍  很荣幸见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colton's team, it's our honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.55,1:26:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们负责守边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys take the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.67,1:26:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火石  杰伊  蛇眼  你们负责边翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint, Jaye, Snake, you guys take the flank.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.14,1:26:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金克斯和白幽灵  你们做内应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jinx and Storm, Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.05,1:26:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎坦会提着手提箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zartan will be holding the briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.10,1:26:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵会是最接近他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm will be the closest man to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.89,1:26:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但直到我们都就位  他才能行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he can't move until we're all in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.73,1:26:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都给我盯着手提箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone keep your eye on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.52,1:26:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抢到它  世界就安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We secure the football, we secure the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.65,1:26:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛇眼  觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snake, how's all that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.07,1:26:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.11,1:26:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍微等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wait. Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.32,1:26:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里  这里和这里仍然有敌人的装甲车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have enemy armour here, here, and here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.20,1:26:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.33,1:26:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些坦克不除  我们就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These tanks survive, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.46,1:26:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克我来解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the tanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.71,1:26:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.83,1:26:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我乔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.42,1:27:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有遗漏吗  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything I missed? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.30,1:27:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滴水不漏  我的任务是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock solid. My orders?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.63,1:27:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解救总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.47,1:27:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 布伦达和我一组  - 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brenda's with my team. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.01,1:27:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布伦达有权选择吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Brenda get a vote?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.97,1:27:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.19,1:27:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又需要人递笔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a pen?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.90,1:27:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的一臂之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.27,1:27:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.86,1:27:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们大干一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's kick that ass! Hoo-ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.41,1:27:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.41,1:27:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这历史性的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A historic day
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.73,1:27:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国总统将会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the President of the United States as he meets with...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.87,1:27:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天下午  总统将会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This afternoon, the President is meeting with
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八大核国家的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the leaders of the eight nuclear powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.37,1:27:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从未有哪位总统如此大胆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never before has a President been so bold
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.37,1:27:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邀请所有领导人同聚一堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to call the leaders of the world together...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.71,1:27:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种史无前例的核会谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are unprecedented nuclear talks that
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.50,1:27:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以往被认为永远不可能发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}most believed would never happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.59,1:27:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问  会谈的警戒将是最高级别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can bet security is at its highest...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.51,1:27:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许比任何时期更接近无核世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may be closer to a nuclear-free world than we have ever been.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.30,1:27:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fellow world leaders,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.60,1:27:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到萨姆特堡的神圣土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}welcome to the hallowed grounds of Fort Sumter,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.81,1:27:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们国家万恶的内战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose proud walls saw the first shots
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.16,1:28:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是在这里打响了第一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in our nation's grievous Civil War.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.69,1:28:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人们曾在这里疯狂地穿过工事上的缺口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, men rushed through the breach in a madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.03,1:28:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们退一步  摒弃自己的恶欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What better place to step back from that same breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.86,1:28:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我们的死敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renounce our darker natures.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.03,1:28:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界将变得更美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive our staunchest foes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.45,1:28:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是一个象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This site is symbolic.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.92,1:28:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅象征着我们谋求的和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only for the peace we seek to achieve,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.79,1:28:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也象征着我们要避免的灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the conflagration we seek to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.09,1:28:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现今的卫士眼镜蛇部队坚信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cobras who protect us today are dedicated to the belief
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.51,1:28:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心态的平和才是最高境界的和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there is no greater peace than peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.81,1:28:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再说一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.48,1:28:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,核武器的存在能让世界更安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is safer with a nuclear presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.65,1:28:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信你的选民也会满意我们的最终提案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure your electorate will be happy by our final proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.24,1:28:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2016年前裁减至一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50% reduction by 2016.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.16,1:28:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在场有许多国家的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a lot of leaders in this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.66,1:29:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有一位来自自由世界的领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But only one leader of the free world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.17,1:29:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.17,1:29:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是我本人  别走神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, stay with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.34,1:29:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要求在座各位全面销毁核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}asked you here with the goal of universal disarmament.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.43,1:29:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,共创无核世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuclear zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.51,1:29:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算来软的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I was prepared to cajole to get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.93,1:29:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要来硬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm now at threaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.77,1:29:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人立即销毁所有库存核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of you will clear out his nuclear closet immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.48,1:29:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不照做的将被视为宣战行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Failure to participate will be considered an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.40,1:29:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're joking, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.95,1:29:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次峰会结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This summit is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.53,1:29:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就到此为止吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.12,1:29:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止了  小子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.74,1:29:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个国家向你们宣战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This country is at war.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.08,1:29:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向你  你  你  你  还有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you and you and you and you and you and you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.26,1:29:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D队就位  E队  开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delta team in position. Echo, you're a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是E队  准备进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Echo. Beginning assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.67,1:30:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.81,1:30:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国核武库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U.S. nuclear arsenal
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.94,1:30:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足以把你们每个国家摧毁14次以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is capable of destroying each of your countries 14 times over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确切的说  能摧毁朝鲜15次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen, in the case of North Korea, just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.07,1:30:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.58,1:30:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只需按下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the push
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.58,1:30:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a button.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.55,1:30:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.89,1:30:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我按下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I pressed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.39,1:30:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是相对而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all relative.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.48,1:30:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你们3分钟时间考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got three minutes to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.94,1:30:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你轮下一班吗  - 无线电保持静音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got next watch? - Maintain radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再坐视不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot, we will not leave a legacy of acquiescence!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.76,1:31:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把手提箱拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.35,1:31:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.98,1:31:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对谁都没好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can be no winners!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.11,1:31:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最高分啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High score.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.36,1:31:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,历史会见证  谁该为这疯狂之举负责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let history record who was responsible for this madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.74,1:31:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.64,1:32:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.70,1:32:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已看到翡翠城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on the Emerald City.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.37,1:32:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊和科尔顿  总统解救行动开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye and Colton, you're a go for POTUS.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.38,1:32:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(总统行宫)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.97,1:32:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.35,1:32:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.19,1:32:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胆固醇有点高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cholesterol's a little high.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是杰伊和科尔顿将军  搞定岗哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaye and General Colton. Checkpoint neutralised.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.86,1:33:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自已保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.21,1:33:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息是下个月不用开全球变暖峰会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the good news is, no global warming summit next month.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.50,1:33:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.17,1:33:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们其中有人在意他的历史地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of us cared enough about his place in history
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.68,1:33:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意单方面摧毁自己的弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to unilaterally disable his warheads.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.93,1:33:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就当是为了子孙后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, in the name of the children.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.68,1:33:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人要自告奋勇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.68,1:33:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有吗  好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.64,1:33:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.87,1:33:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call your people to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.20,1:33:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a complete lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.20,1:33:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将要摧毁亚洲的可是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Says the man about to destroy Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.75,1:33:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人跟风吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, who's going to follow suit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.42,1:33:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们打算眼睁睁地看着地球毁灭吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you really going to stand by and watch as Earth is destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.05,1:34:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们终止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.05,1:34:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(法国  洲际导弹已毁)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.27,1:34:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,估计就剩朝鲜没按了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured North Korea for last.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.11,1:34:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子真讨人喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to love the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.53,1:34:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.20,1:34:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到无核世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to a nuclear-free world.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.12,1:34:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留心看你们祖国的实况图像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to direct your attention to live images of your homelands.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.05,1:34:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在大家看到的是一套先进的武器系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you're looking at an advanced weapons system
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.97,1:34:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫宙斯计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we call Project Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.10,1:34:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一共有7颗宙斯卫星环绕地球飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are seven Zeus satellites orbiting Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.77,1:34:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每颗卫星都有10根中空的铂金管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each satellite contains 10 hollow platinum tubes
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.65,1:34:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每根管里填充着一根钨棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with a tungsten rod.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.02,1:35:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宙斯卫星1A到达伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zeus satellite 1-A approaching London.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备就绪  等待空投批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ordnance live and loaded. Awaiting drop authorisation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.49,1:35:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了让钨条击中目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, to direct a rod to its target,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.81,1:35:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we don't launch it or fire it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.16,1:35:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们进行空投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只靠重力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravity does the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.30,1:35:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observe.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.34,1:35:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卫星1A  已获远程发射批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellite 1-A. We have remote launch authorisation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.68,1:35:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三  二  一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.85,1:35:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.31,1:35:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钨棒到达地面的速度比子弹快8倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rod touches down eight times faster than a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.69,1:35:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀伤力也远超于核弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with a force significantly greater than a nuclear warhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.86,1:35:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会产生放射性尘埃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of the fallout.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.37,1:35:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有无限的乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of the fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.52,1:36:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须对此负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have to answer for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.14,1:36:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的国会和法院会追究你的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To your Congress, your courts.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.90,1:36:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,错了  是他们要听我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correction, they will have to answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.57,1:36:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.15,1:36:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.93,1:36:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜蛇革命开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cobra revolution has begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.02,1:37:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎坦按下按钮后已启动自动投放程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By pressing that button, Zartan initiated an auto-drop sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.94,1:37:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的宙斯卫星正向着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Zeus satellites are moving into position
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.82,1:37:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其余6个国家飞去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over your six remaining countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.03,1:37:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卫星2A至7A正前往目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites 2-A through 7-A en route to targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.61,1:37:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按下同一个键  就能终止这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same button that begins this can end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.03,1:37:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I only press it for a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.04,1:37:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是绝对的臣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total allegiance.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷  搞定外围的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block, secure the perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.36,1:37:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从扎坦那儿把控制箱拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the control case from Zartan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把他们全灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to drop them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.66,1:37:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往大门跑  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head for the door, now! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.82,1:38:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卫星正飞往目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites en route to targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.82,1:38:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始执行指令程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beginning command protocols.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.03,1:39:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着地面部队  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow that ground team! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.54,1:39:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.51,1:39:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你的六点钟方向  眼镜蛇2号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your six, Cobra two!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.40,1:39:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜蛇1号  我无法锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cobra one, Cobra one, I need eyes on! Eyes on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.29,1:40:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.26,1:40:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把她逼到角落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got her cornered.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.28,1:40:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她走投无路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ain't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.83,1:40:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.81,1:41:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵  没想到你加入了特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm. I never figured you for a Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.77,1:41:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你太失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.71,1:41:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真难打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a bitch to hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.39,1:42:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.90,1:42:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.98,1:42:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这把刀从来不适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this sword was never intended
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.74,1:42:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制不了自己怒火的人使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for anyone with anger management issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.60,1:43:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么声音  - 别吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.69,1:43:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 雷  - 是的  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ray? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.11,1:43:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去门口看一下  回来汇报情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the door. Give me a sit rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.69,1:43:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.00,1:43:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩守住入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two secure the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.73,1:44:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要干嘛  - 跟我走  离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Let's go. We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.74,1:44:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别过来  不然我就开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down. I'm gonna shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.57,1:44:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.74,1:44:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖放下武器  让我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a good G.I. Joe and drop the gun. We're walking out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.54,1:44:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就朝他脑袋开枪  听见没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will shoot him in the head. Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.25,1:44:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都聋了吗  把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not listening, are you? Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.17,1:44:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.93,1:44:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.18,1:44:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按住伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put some pressure on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.80,1:44:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科尔顿将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Colton.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.56,1:44:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很高兴见到你  - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good to see you. - Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.35,1:44:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉  总统先生  - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry, Mr President. - No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.60,1:44:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.19,1:44:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.73,1:44:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拦路虎  总统获救  无人伤亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roadblock, POTUS secure. No casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.86,1:44:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到了  杰伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, Jaye.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.66,1:44:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了哈德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed the Hard Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.67,1:45:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还把我变成了今天这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And made me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.42,1:45:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.92,1:45:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道那是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I can see that was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.61,1:45:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要尽快找到萤火虫和眼镜蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need eyes on Firefly and Cobra ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.75,1:45:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,院子找遍了  没看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courtyard clear. No sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.34,1:45:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥官  我拿到箱子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, I have the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可按原计划进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are still a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.30,1:45:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离空投还有多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long till drop?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.31,1:46:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与原计划相符  指挥官  还有五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On schedule, Commander. Five minutes to live fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.35,1:46:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终锁定即将开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final targeting to begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.52,1:46:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宙斯卫星4号和7号已就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zeus satellites 4 and 7 in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.73,1:46:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卫星2  3  5  6号已锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zeus satellites 2, 3, 5, and 6 are locked on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.53,1:46:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.53,1:46:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法国  俄罗斯  朝鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}France, Russia, North Korea,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.32,1:46:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,印度  以色列  中国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}India, Israel, China.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.18,1:46:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虎爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.10,1:46:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼镜蛇指挥官逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cobra Commander's bugging out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.52,1:46:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没看见萤火虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of Firefly.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.27,1:46:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.37,1:47:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目标已锁定  武器装载中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targets acquired. Ordnance live and loading.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.58,1:47:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宙斯4号已做好发射准备  舱口已打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zeus 4 is ready to fire. Hatch is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.43,1:47:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 搞定他  - 干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him! - Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.24,1:48:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要拿箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want that case?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.37,1:48:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先得过我这一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to come through me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.42,1:48:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.01,1:48:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有卫星开始装弹  准备倒计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All satellites have begun load for final countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.66,1:49:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射密码确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch codes confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.71,1:49:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒数10秒发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds to live fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.67,1:49:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.00,1:49:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.42,1:49:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.09,1:50:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七  六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven. Six.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.80,1:50:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.97,1:50:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.39,1:50:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.85,1:50:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.14,1:50:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(手控终止)
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.45,1:50:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,危机解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Threat terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.62,1:50:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B队  外围已安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Team Bravo, perimeter has been cleared and secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.95,1:51:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe Command to covert operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.79,1:51:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已控制外围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have control of the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.95,1:51:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医护人员已到场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical personnel are on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.87,1:51:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有特种兵已归队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Joes are accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.21,1:52:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.59,1:52:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统今日已安全回到总统办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President is back safe in the Oval Office today,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.89,1:52:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为特种部队主持表彰典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}presiding over a ceremony honouring the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.31,1:52:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随着世界恢复秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the world back in order,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.86,1:52:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各地重建工作也已经展开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rebuilding has begun around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.23,1:52:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些站在我们身边的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who stand beside us,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.65,1:52:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世人只知他们是特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world knows them as Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.40,1:52:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还知道  他们是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know them as heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.08,1:52:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.08,1:52:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.00,1:52:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.46,1:52:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.09,1:52:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊·伯内特上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jaye Burnett.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.18,1:52:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你父亲是战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I served with your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.81,1:52:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会为你感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd be very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.65,1:53:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们  先生们  向特种部队致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, the G.I. Joes.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.51,1:53:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留给你找到眼镜蛇指挥官的时候用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For when you find Cobra Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.81,1:53:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里能找到你  将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where can we find you, General?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.27,1:53:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我下命令就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just need my orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.19,1:53:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的组合可是所向无敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we'd make a hell of a team.

